{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/09/14/8655236/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パート1"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/09/14/8655236/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パート2"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気でーす(V)o¥o(V)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は氣志團万博！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、アナザースカイに綾小路さん出てましたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野外の大きなステージに参加させてもらえて光栄です。きっと他のアーティストのファンの方もたくさんいるであろう...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯の調子が悪いっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音が遅れて鳴ったり、写真は撮れないし、写真フォルダを見ようとすると全部画質が落ちてザラザラに..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故じゃ(つД`)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日まであんなに元気やったやん...先生は悲しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢のはなし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校からの帰り道を、自転車で帰る\n後ろに誰か乗せている(耳をすませばの雫の乗り方をされててバランスがとりにくい)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地面に、ひとつひとつ袋に入った半熟生たまごが落ちてる道をうろうろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.4個拾って食べたのち、神社に向かう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神社には遠めでもわかるくらい半熟生たまごが大量に落ちてる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じいさんが出てきて、「こうして食べると美味しい」と教えてくれる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"果たして誰を後ろに乗せていたのか...わからん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/nanase.nishino/img/2013/09/14/8655236/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パーカーなりけり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●なーさんはやられたら何倍返しでやりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"倍返しだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘です。返せません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●なーちゃんは犬のどこが好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前を呼ぶと、耳を動かして尻尾ふりながらこっちに来てくれるとこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●次の中で選ぶならどれですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A シュークリーム"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"B エクレア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"C フリーザ（第三形態）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フリ......シュークリーム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●秋と言えば食欲の秋ですが七瀬さんは秋の味覚で何が一番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かぼちゃ、栗、梨、どいやさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"●どんなにつらいことがあっても夢を追う人生の方が安定した人生より百倍楽しいですよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいっっっ"}],"source":"archive"}